What is Agentic AI?

Agentic AI is the next evolution of AI agents.

Instead of simply answering one question, it can:

Set goals
Break goals into tasks
Plan multiple steps
Use different tools
Evaluate results
Correct mistakes
Continue until the goal is achieved

It behaves more like an autonomous digital worker.

===

Agentic AI Workflow
Goal

 ↓

Plan

 ↓

Choose Tool

 ↓

Execute

 ↓

Evaluate

 ↓

Need another step?

Yes → Repeat

No → Finish

======
Example

User:

I want to travel from Chennai to Madurai tomorrow with a sleeper bus under ₹1200.

An Agentic AI could:

Search buses
Compare fares
Check available seats
Recommend the best option
Suggest boarding points
Explain cancellation policies
Complete the booking (if integrated)
Send the ticket by email or WhatsApp

This involves planning, multiple tools, and adapting based on results.

